[A.]
<h2>Storage Factory</h2>
<i>DL Leader: ~wThe time is at hand to make strikes against the SWORD, SPU, and GOF.  Also, I want to thank you Commander of the FW.<br>
<i>You: ~wYour welcome...<br>
<i>Your Leader: ~wThat's are purpose, to help the good.<br>
<i>DL Leader: ~wI will prove a more then worthy ally.<br>
<i>Your Leader: ~wSo, does that mean you will help in this Operation?<br>
<i>DL Leader: ~wMost certainly...But you, commander, have to strike quick.  For they will surely start harvesting the storm power after our preseace is known.<br>
<i>You: ~wYes, sir.<br>
$Button=What ya got,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Capture the Factory,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<i>You: ~wMission Accomplished!
<i>DL Leader: ~We shall spread this up 5-way.  One for the DL guild, one for the ^WaR^ guild, one for the FW guild, one for the allaince of Light.
<i>You: ~wWhat about the fiveth?<br>
<i>DL Leader: ~wYou get it for your army.<br>
<i>You: ~wCool...Where to next?<br>
<i>DL Leader: To my homeland, to fight the SWORD there.
$Button=OK,MissionBegin,FWSO3

